    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "C99A4D82D0941001",
      "text": "Geht es Agya unverändert gut?[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "C3836108EE7B8717",
      "text": "Ja, es geht ihm super!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "C3836208EE7B88CA",
      "text": "Ja, es fliegt sehr gern umher!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "C99A4C82D0940E4E",
      "text": "Das freut mich zu hören.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "C99A4F82D0941367",
      "text": "Ich war etwas besorgt, weil es solch eine große\\nMenge meines Mittels zu sich genommen hatte.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "C99A4E82D09411B4",
      "text": "Dass ihm das keine Probleme bereitet hat,\\nkönnte von einer überragenden Willenskraft\\r\\nzeugen.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp01_06",
      "hash64": "C99A5182D09416CD",
      "text": "Es wäre sicher gefährlich, einem gewöhnlichen\\nPokémon dieselbe Menge zuzumuten.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp01_07",
      "hash64": "C99A5082D094151A",
      "text": "Üblicherweise absolvieren Trainer das Flugrennen\\nauf dem Rücken eines Panzaeron. Somit kommt\\r\\nmein Mittel nicht oft zum Einsatz.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp01_08",
      "hash64": "C99A4382D093FF03",
      "text": "Mehr habe ich gerade nicht mitzuteilen.\\nBeenden wir unser Gespräch.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "F484C1778787444C",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Ich habe eine Frage an dich,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "F484C277878745FF",
      "text": "Woher kennst du Jo?[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "D2A78799FC4F6886",
      "text": "Von einer Exkursion!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "D2A78699FC4F66D3",
      "text": "Wir waren Teampartner.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "F484C377878747B2",
      "text": "Von solch einem Ereignis wusste ich nichts.\\c\\nDoch ich erinnere mich, dass er in Kitakami war,\\nbevor er sich verändert hat.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp02_02b",
      "hash64": "04DFF41B4ADF0670",
      "text": "Ihr wart... P-Partner?!\\c\\nÄhem, entschuldige bitte.\\c\\nIhr habt also auf eurer Exkursion für eine\\nGruppenarbeit zu zweit zusammengearbeitet.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "F484C47787874965",
      "text": "Ich wollte herausfinden, woher Jos Übereifer\\nrührt, wenn es um dich geht.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "F484BD7787873D80",
      "text": "Aber es scheint nicht daran zu liegen,\\nwie ihr euch kennengelernt habt.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "F484BE7787873F33",
      "text": "Meine Frage wäre damit beantwortet.\\nVielen Dank.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "F12997725EAB7B3D",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)][VAR 0x0100(0000)]. Ich würde gerne etwas\\nbesprechen.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "F12996725EAB798A",
      "text": "In letzter Zeit habe ich ein merkwürdiges\\nVerhalten bei mir selbst festgestellt.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "F12995725EAB77D7",
      "text": "Hin und wieder verspüre ich Appetitlosigkeit\\nund ein Engegefühl in der Brust.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "F12994725EAB7624",
      "text": "Doch bei meinen ärztlichen Untersuchungen\\nwurde nichts Ungewöhnliches diagnostiziert.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "F12993725EAB7471",
      "text": "Ich befürchte, dass sich etwas in mir abspielt,\\ndas sich nicht leicht kategorisieren lässt.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "56E9BF2FE7EA6109",
      "text": "Hast du einen Verdacht?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "56E9BC2FE7EA5BF0",
      "text": "Wann geht es dir denn so?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "F12992725EAB72BE",
      "text": "Ich hab leider keine Ahnung.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_05b",
      "hash64": "7516B456DD542BD4",
      "text": "Das Eintreten dieses Zustands scheint keinen\\nRegeln zu folgen.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "F12991725EAB710B",
      "text": "Allerdings ist mir aufgefallen, dass die Symptome\\nhäufiger auftreten, wenn ich über Jo nachdenke.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_07",
      "hash64": "F12990725EAB6F58",
      "text": "Ich kann keinerlei kausalen Zusammenhang\\nzwischen diesen Umständen feststellen.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_08",
      "hash64": "F1298F725EAB6DA5",
      "text": "*seufz*[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "88C64154CA3E800F",
      "text": "Das Gespräch mit dir scheint meine Beschwerden\\ngelindert zu haben, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
